==Dutch==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|nl|dum|saterdach}}, calque of {{etyl|la|nl}} {{m|la|dies Saturni}}. Compare Low German {{m|nds|Saterdag}}, West Frisian {{m|fy|saterdei}}, English {{m|en|Saturday}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈzaːtərˌdɑx/|lang=nl}}
* {{audio|Nl-zaterdag.ogg|audio|lang=nl}}

===Noun===
{{nl-noun|m|-:en|zaterdagje}}

# [[Saturday]]

